Here's a concise template for calculating the offset of an element in an array:

```cpp
template <typename T>
size_t calculateOffset(T* basePtr, T* elementPtr) {
    // Validate input pointers are within the same array
    if (elementPtr < basePtr) return static_cast<size_t>(-1);

    // Calculate offset by subtracting base pointer from element pointer
    return static_cast<size_t>(elementPtr - basePtr);
}
```

